      "type": "text",
      "text": "Defined in the codebase but NOT wired into\nthis runtime path today:\n\n- Finding / DomainVerdict / scoring.py\n  (empty) -> no aggregate score produced\n- output.JSONLWriter\n  --output is accepted, logged, never written to\n- Referential (R-01..04), Lexical (L-01..04),\n  Encoding (E-01/02), Statistical (S-01..03),\n  Certificate-metadata (C-01)\n  registered in rules.py, no evaluator yet",
